[SNOTLOUT]
Oh, I'm sorry, Fishlegs! Did you want that?
ໂອ້, ຂ້ອຍຂໍໂທດ, Fishlegs! ເຈົ້າຢາກນັ້ນບໍ?

6
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:41,300
[FISHLEGS]
Snotlout! That's mine! Snotlout FALLS BACK toward RUFFNUT and TUFFNUT, who lag on their two-headed Zippleback, BARF & BELCH.
ໂຊນຕລູຕ໌! ນັ້ນແມ່ນຂອງຂ້ອຍ! Snotlout ຕົກກັບຄືນໄປບ່ອນໄປຫາ RUFFNUT ແລະ
TUFFNutt, ຜູ້ທີ່ຊ້າຢູ່ເທິງ Zippleback ສອງຫົວຂອງພວກເຂົາ, BARF & BELCH.

7
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:47,800
[SNOTLOUT]
Here ya go, babe. With a chivalrous grin, Snotlout tosses the sheep to Ruffnut. She SNATCHES it with a sneer and a GRUMBLE.
ມາແລ້ວແມ. ດ້ວຍຄວາມມ່ວນຊື່ນທີ່ກະຕຸ້ນໃຈ, Snotlout
ຖິ້ມແມວໄປຫາ Ruffnut. ນາງ SNACHES ມັນດ້ວຍການໂຊກຮ້າຍແລະຈົ່ມ.

8
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:52,500
[SNOTLOUT]
Did I tell you that you look amazing today? `Cause you do.
ຂ້ອຍບອກເຈົ້າບໍວ່າເຈົ້າເບິ່ງດີເລີດມື້ນີ້? ` ເພາະວ່າເຈົ້າເຮັດ.

9
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:59,000
[RUFFNUT]
Come on, Barf. It's starting to stink around here. Barf starts to peel off, spewing gas. Tuffnut mocks Snotlout with a mugging grin.
ມາແລ້ວ, ບາຟ໌. ມັນ ກໍາ ລັງເລີ່ມກິ່ນຫອມຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້. ບາກຟ໌ເລີ່ມເປືອກຫຸ້ມຫໍ່ອອກ
, ປ່ອຍແກັສ. Tuffnut ໂຊກຮ້າຍ Snotlout ດ້ວຍຄວາມມ່ວນຊື່ນທີ່ລັກລອບ.

10
00:00:59,500 --> 00:01:05,500
[TUFFNUT]
Nope. Still hates you. Let's blow this place, Belch! Belch ignites the gas, sparking a flashy explosion, and leaving Snotlout behind in the smoke. As they rush past the main bleachers, Ruffnut DROPS her sheep into one of five baskets suspended over a chasm at the lap crossing. Each backboard bears an image of its corresponding dragon. The Barf/Belch basket filled to the brim with sheep. Presiding over the game, STOICK turns to the frenzied crowd.
ຄຸເຂົ່າລົງ

11
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:12,000
[STOICK]
That's nine for the Twins, Astrid lags with three, Fishlegs and Snotlout trail with NONE! Stoick eyes an empty basket at the far end, its backboard painted with an image of Toothless.
ຄຸເຂົ່າລົງ

12
