[FISHLEGS]
Good job, Meatlug! Fishlegs tosses his captured prize to Ruffnut.
ວຽກງານທີ່ດີ, Meatlug! Fishlegs ຖິ້ມລາງວັນທີ່ຖືກຈັບໄວ້ໃຫ້ Ruffnut.

31
00:02:37,350 --> 00:02:42,600
[FISHLEGS]
Here you go, darling. Mine's worth ten! HTTYD 2  - FINAL DRAFT - 05/05/14 5.
ມາແລ້ວແມ. ຂອງຂ້ອຍມີມູນຄ່າສິບ! HTTYD
2 - Draft ສຸດທ້າຍ - 05/05/14 5.

32
00:02:43,100 --> 00:02:45,550
[RUFFNUT]
Yeah! The Black Sheep! Snotlout sighs, frustrated.
ແມ່ນແລ້ວ! ແມວສີດໍາ! Snotlout sigh, ໂຊກຮ້າຍ.

